~ start
if Story.set_flag("met_chant_trembling")
	Chauntecleer The Tracker: My hands haven't trembled like this since Saberhagen.
=> questions

~ questions
- Saberhagen?
	=> saberhagen
- Why are your hands trembling?
	=> hands
- Never mind.
	=> END

~ hands
Chauntecleer The Tracker: I ran so fast, all I saw were the talons of a bird, wings like a dragon, and a tail that looked like a snake.
Chauntecleer The Tracker: I've never seen anything like it. I ran and didn't look back.
Chauntecleer The Tracker: Oh... Gorek is still in the forest. I hope he's okay.
=> questions

~ saberhagen
Chauntecleer The Tracker: I was only a young man when we defeated him...
Chauntecleer The Tracker: But I have nightmares that one day Minerva won't be strong enough to bind Saberhagen any longer.
Chauntecleer The Tracker: He may look like a cat, but he is still very powerful.
=> questions
